{{Target Bird Set|image1=WondershopSetYellowWhiteBlue2023.webp|caption-image1=This Christmas figurine set includes three yellow-beaked birds dressed in vibrant warm gear — one with a light blue fuzzy scarf and a red Santa hat, the second with a white faux-fur scarf and a white knit hat and the third with a light yellow knit scarf and a brown trapper hat.|target.com_title=3pc Featherly Friends Bird Wearing Scarf Fabric Christmas Figurine Set - Wondershop™ Yellow/White/Blue|target.com_description=Create an im-peck-able holiday display with this 3-Piece Featherly Friends Bird Wearing Scarf Fabric Figurine Set from Wondershop™. This Christmas figurine set includes three yellow-beaked birds dressed in vibrant warm gear — one with a light blue fuzzy scarf and a red Santa hat, the second with a white faux-fur scarf and a white knit hat and the third with a light yellow knit scarf and a brown trapper hat. Made of soft fabric, these cute bird figurines will add a fun, nature-themed vibe to your festive decor, whether you keep them on your mantel, tabletop, windowsill or around your Christmas tree.

