{{Target Bird Set|image1=Nativity2023.webp|caption-image1=The decorative nativity scene set includes a brown-and-white manger with a glitter star and three yellow-beaked fabric birds dressed as the Holy Family. The two larger birds in green and pink represent Joseph and Mary, while the tiny white bird in the brown bed represents Baby Jesus.|target.com_title=4pc Featherly Friends Fabric Bird Christmas Nativity Scene Figurine Set - Wondershop™|target.com_description=This 4-Piece Featherly Friends Fabric Bird Nativity Scene Figurine Set from Wondershop™ gives the classic Christmas decoration a delightfully adorable twist. The decorative nativity scene set includes a brown-and-white manger with a glitter star and three yellow-beaked fabric birds dressed as the Holy Family. The two larger birds in green and pink represent Joseph and Mary, while the tiny white bird in the brown bed represents Baby Jesus. Cute and colorful, this nativity scene stands out on any tabletop, shelf or counter without taking up much space, and it also makes a thoughtful seasonal gift.

Welcome to the Wondershop™.|color=White, brown, gold, green blue, pink, red|type=Bird Set with Accessories|birds_in_set=[[w:c:target-birds:Mary Nativity|Mary Nativity]], [[w:c:target-birds:Joseph Nativity|Joseph Nativity]], and [[w:c:target-birds:Jesus Nativity|Jesus Nativity]]|accessories_in_set=Nativity Set Christmas 2023|collection=[[w:c:target-birds:Christmas 2023 Releases|Christmas 2023]]|season=[[w:c:target-birds:Christmas Releases|Christmas]]|year=[[w:c:target-birds:2023 Releases|2023]]|release_date=September 2023}}

This is a set that includes a barn with a gold star in the center, a manger with a small blue baby bird representing Jesus in it, a bird representing Joseph in green, and a bird representing Mary in pink and red.  No bird in the set has a foot tag.

{{Target Bird Set|image1=GingerbreadFabricBirdChristmas2023.webp|caption-image1=This Christmas figurine set includes a gingerbread house with vibrant pompoms on the rooftop and three yellow-beaked, brown-footed birds in eye-catching winter gear. The two larger gingerbread birds are in pink and blue with red neck adornments and the smaller bird has red candy stripes and a white knit scarf for a charming, cozy look.|target.com_title=4pc Featherly Friends Gingerbread Fabric Bird Christmas Figurine Set - Wondershop™|target.com_description=Create an im-peck-ably cute and colorful holiday display in your home with this 4-Piece Featherly Friends Gingerbread Fabric Bird Figurine Set from Wondershop™. This Christmas figurine set includes a gingerbread house with vibrant pompoms on the rooftop and three yellow-beaked, brown-footed birds in eye-catching winter gear. The two larger gingerbread birds are in pink and blue with red neck adornments and the smaller bird has red candy stripes and a white knit scarf for a charming, cozy look. The pieces can be rearranged to your taste to add a playful, nature-themed vibe into your festive decor.

Welcome to the Wondershop™.|color=Brown, red, green, pink, blue, white, yellow|type=Bird Set with Accessories|birds_in_set=[[w:c:target-birds:Gingerbread Pink|Gingerbread Pink]], [[w:c:target-birds:Gingerbread Blue|Gingerbread Blue]], [[w:c:target-birds:Peppermint Gingerbread Mini|Peppermint Gingerbread Mini]]|accessories_in_set=Gingerbread Set House Christmas 2023|collection=[[w:c:target-birds:Christmas 2023 Releases|Christmas 2023]]|season=[[w:c:target-birds:Christmas Releases|Christmas]]|year=[[w:c:target-birds:2023 Releases|2023]]|release_date=September 2023|set=[[w:c:target-birds:4pc Featherly Friends Gingerbread Fabric Bird Christmas Figurine Set - Wondershop™|4pc Featherly Friends Gingerbread Fabric Bird Christmas Figurine Set - Wondershop™]]}}

This is a set that includes a gingerbread house with a star in the center, candy on the roof, green tree on the left, and red and green presents on the right, two regular gingerbread birds, and a mini peppermint bird.  No bird in the set has a foot tag.

{{Target Bird|title1=Amado|image1=[[Amado.jpg]]|caption-image1=This felt bird figurine is ready for the celebrations, with a black body that serves as the perfect backdrop for a sugar skull face and marigold accents in traditional vibrant hues of pink, orange, green and aqua.|target.com_title=Día de Muertos Featherly Friends Sugar Skull Bird Decorative Figurine - Designed with Luis Fitch|target.com_description=Bring a sweet touch to your Dia de Muertos decorations with the Dia de Muertos Featherly Friends Sugar Skull Bird Decorative Figurine from Luis Fitch x Target. This felt bird figurine is ready for the celebrations, with a black body that serves as the perfect backdrop for a sugar skull face and marigold accents in traditional vibrant hues of pink, orange, green and aqua. At six inches tall, the sugar skull bird is a great size to stand out on its own when placed on an end table or shelf as an extra bit of decoration, while also being small enough to fit right in among other decorations on your ofrenda.
Originating in Mexico, the colorful Dia de Muertos celebration is a time-honored tradition to remember loved ones. Now, visual artist Luis Fitch shares his native Mexican heritage and passion for cross-cultural connections in a vibrant Dia de Muertos collaboration. Fitch combines elements of fire, earth, water and air in eye-catching detail — offering the beauty of the holiday to all.|color=Black, pink, orange, green, aqua, purple|type=[[Birds|Bird]]|collection=[[Dia de los Muertos 2021 Releases|Dia de los Muertos 2021]]|holiday/season=[[Dia de los Muertos Releases|Dia de los Muertos ]]|year=[[2021 Releases|2021]]}}

This bird has a tag on its left leg that says "Amado" on one side and "2021" on the other. It was designed by Mexican artist Luis Fitch. "Amado" is Spanish for "beloved."

{{Target Bird|title1=Amavida|image1=[[Amavida.png]]|caption-image1=Made with Styrofoam, this calavera bird comes in blue, pink and white hues with blue legs for an eye-catching look.|target.com_title=Día de Muertos Featherly Friends Calavera Bird Amavida - Designed with Flavia Z Drago|target.com_description=Spruce up the look of your ofrenda with the Día de Muertos Featherly Friends Calavera Bird Amavida. Made with Styrofoam, this calavera bird comes in blue, pink and white hues with blue legs for an eye-catching look. Simply place it alongside a shadow box frame and decorate the wall with Papel Picado garland for a festive look.

Originating in Mexico, the colorful Día de Muertos celebration is a time-honored tradition to remember loved ones. Now, designer Flavia Z Drago shares her native Mexican heritage and detailed illustrations in a vibrant Día de Muertos collection. Drago combines color, texture and imagination to offer the beauty of the holiday to all.|color=Pink, yellow, blue, white, black|type=[[Birds|Bird]]|collection=[[Dia de los Muertos 2022 Releases|Dia de los Muertos 2022]]|holiday/season=[[Dia de los Muertos Releases|Dia de los Muertos]]|year=[[2022 Releases|2022]]}}

This bird has a tag on its left leg that says "Amavida" on one side and "2022" on the other. It was designed by Mexican illustrator Flavia Z. Drago.

