{{Target Bird|image1=Carrot.jpg|caption-image1=The adorable pink bird holding a carrot is crafted from coated fabric.|target.com_description=This Target Spritz Easter 2023 figurine from the Featherly Friends collection is a delightful addition to any Easter decor. The adorable pink bird holding a carrot is crafted from coated fabric and stands 7.5 inches tall by 4 inches wide. Perfect for collectors or as a seasonal decoration, this original piece features the Easter Bunny, carrots, and festive Easter themes.

